@startuml STATE-01
!include ../theme.puml
title STATE-01 — Vòng đời Booking (BookingStateMachineServiceImpl)
[*] --> PENDING
PENDING --> ACCEPTED
PENDING --> REJECTED
PENDING --> CANCELLED
PENDING --> EXPIRED
ACCEPTED --> DEPOSIT_PENDING : optional waiting state
ACCEPTED --> CONFIRMED : V6 30% Deposit PAID (VietQR webhook / Demo gateway)
ACCEPTED --> CANCELLED
ACCEPTED --> EXPIRED
ACCEPTED --> COMPLETED : legacy direct path
DEPOSIT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED : V6 30% Deposit PAID (VietQR webhook / Demo gateway)
DEPOSIT_PENDING --> CANCELLED
DEPOSIT_PENDING --> EXPIRED
CONFIRMED --> SHOOTING
CONFIRMED --> POST_PROCESSING
CONFIRMED --> DELIVERED
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED
CONFIRMED --> DISPUTED
CONFIRMED --> COMPLETED
SHOOTING --> POST_PROCESSING
SHOOTING --> DELIVERED
SHOOTING --> COMPLETED
SHOOTING --> DISPUTED
POST_PROCESSING --> DELIVERED
POST_PROCESSING --> COMPLETED
POST_PROCESSING --> DISPUTED
DELIVERED --> POST_PROCESSING : revision
DELIVERED --> COMPLETED : customer accepts
DELIVERED --> DISPUTED
COMPLETED --> DISPUTED
DISPUTED --> COMPLETED
DISPUTED --> CANCELLED
REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
note right of CONFIRMED
  Mọi transition cùng trạng thái là idempotent
  và không tạo BookingHistory mới.
end note
@enduml

